### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

###

### Register
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@test.com",
  "password": "demo123"
}

###

### Login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@test.com",
  "password": "demo123"
}

###

@token = {{login.response.body.data.access_token}}

### Get Current User
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### List Trending Products
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### List Products - Filtered
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/products?region=US&category=Electronics&min_score=50&sort=score&order=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get Single Product (replace with real ID)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/products/{{$dotenv PRODUCT_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get Product Score History (replace with real ID)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/products/{{$dotenv PRODUCT_ID}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Pipeline Status
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/status/pipeline

###
